        <mxCell id="c3" value="A first notice of loss becomes a settled, auditable decision from the claim&#x27;s own evidence. A deterministic gate screens first, five agents investigate the photos and paperwork, and every figure that touches money is computed by versioned Python &amp;#8212; never by a model." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3C4A63;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
